 "self_load_only": true,
 "description": "BIGVILLE R14 (block 262000) -- DEATH -> INHERITANCE. On death (dead==1) the estate passes: bl_inherit_land (each owned Plot's owns edge moves dead->heir, sequential -- LAND CONSERVED, R13) + bl_inherit_house (owns_house, R7) + bl_inherit_coin (lump coin, once via coin_bequeathed). With NO heir (has_heir==0, a structural fact set at ingest) the estate REVERTS to the COUNCIL / commons (bl_inherit_commons_land/_house/_coin) -- ties R13 conservation: the estate is TRANSFERRED, never destroyed. NO rule mints or destroys a Plot/House node (no add_node/del_node); every transfer MOVES an edge. Composes existing DSL Terms; ZERO new Rust.",
